@archive 0019
@size 11

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"와자 때와 똑같아 보이는데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이번에는 안에서 무슨 일이\n벌어지고 있는지 알려 줄 사람이\n아무도 없어서 안타깝네."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"안에 몇 명이나\n있는 걸까?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
